{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/781006-question-about-titled-commoners-and-houses","id":781006,"title":"Question About Titled Commoners and Houses","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-06T01:22:43-08:00","id":781006,"title":"Question About Titled Commoners and Houses","content":"This question recently came up at a game: do commoners who gain a title necessarily have a House, or can an ennobled commoner be independent? I seem to remember reading somewhere that ennobled commoners were, by default, not members of a House and that becoming a member of a House was a separate deal, but I can't seem to find anything in the books one way or another. Does anyone know if there is an official answer to this and, if so, can you point me to the book (or other source)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5910-csschulz","name":"CSSchulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5910_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T03:58:32-08:00","id":781063,"title":"","content":"You're right:<br /> <br /> 'Commoners given a noble title are not automatically members of the house that ennobled them. Joining the house requires that the house accepts them (which can involve rigorous tests) and that they swear fealty to the house.'<br /> <br /> Under confirmed rules clarifications and errata here: <a href=\"http://webspace.webring.com/people/te/eshu_roger/errata.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://webspace.webring.com/people/t...er/errata.html</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T23:30:58-08:00","id":781578,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the link! It says the confirmed stuff was stated by writers or developers. It'd be nice to find the original source. Were these posted on the old White-Wolf site as official errata/clarifications in the before times, the long long ago, perhaps?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5910-csschulz","name":"CSSchulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5910_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T06:02:13-08:00","id":781670,"title":"","content":"Probably. There was some errata and dev chat transripts posted on the old White Wolf site. You still see those with the Wayback Machine - <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030214193759/http://www.white-wolf.com/changeling.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://web.archive.org/web/20030214...hangeling.html</a><br /> <br /> Most of it was in forum posts though. There's no comprehensive archive for those that I know of. Bits and pieces got saved here and there though. For example, I have Pete Woodworth's posts about cut material from Time of Judgement in my sig (ToJ: The 14th House).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}